<title>USA: AT&amp;T sets new campaign.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T sets new campaign.</headline>
<dateline>BASKING RIDGE, N.J. 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said Monday that its customers can now use 1-800-CALL-ATT to place all calls, both local and long distance, when not at home.</p>
<p>The company said it will launch a new advertising campaign promoting the service for all collect and calling card calls.</p>
